          "cookies": [],
          "content": {
            "size": 3010,
            "mimeType": "application/json",
            "text": "{\"transactionId\":\"e0f8239b-22b7-a13b-81f4-3b05f20308ec\",\"isSuccess\":true,\"content\":{\"messageKey\":\"NO_TEETIMES\",\"messageTemplate\":\"No tee times available\",\"messageAppearance\":\"Appears on the tee sheet when there are no tee times available on a selected day\",\"messageDetail\":\"<p><strong>No Tee Times Available for Your Selected Day</strong></p><p>We understand how challenging it can be to secure a tee time—especially during peak season. While there is currently no availability for your selected date, please know that cancellations do occur, and new times may become available.</p><p>To improve your chances, we recommend the following:</p><p><br></p><ul><li><strong>7 Days in Advance</strong>: We send reminder emails to guests with existing bookings, which often results in cancellations and open time slots.</li><li><strong>72 Hours Before Play</strong>: This is the final window for a full deposit refund, making it the most common time for cancellations.</li></ul><p><strong>Waitlist Notice</strong></p><p>Starting <strong>Monday, April 13, 2026</strong>, you can call the <strong>Reservations Office at 403‑591‑7070</strong> to add your name to the waitlist. Please note that you may only reserve a spot <strong>one month in advance</strong> of your desired tee time.</p><p><br></p><p>Tee times must be reserved as either <strong>twosomes or foursomes</strong>. The individual making the reservation is responsible for securing and paying the deposit <strong>for all spots at the time of booking</strong>.</p><p><br></p><ul><li>You may adjust a <strong>foursome to a twosome</strong> if needed.</li><li>However, reductions from <strong>two to one</strong> or <strong>four to three players</strong> will <strong>not be permitted</strong>.</li><li><br></li></ul><p>If a foursome becomes a group of three, the group is responsible for filling the fourth spot to avoid a <strong>cancellation or no-show fee of $175 per player</strong>. If we are able to pair your group with a single golfer, a refund for the fourth spot will be issued. We appreciate your cooperation and understanding as we continue working to provide a smooth and enjoyable experience for all guests.</p><p><br></p><p><strong>Booking Deposit</strong></p><p>A deposit of <strong>$35 per player</strong> is required at the time of booking. For a foursome, this totals <strong>$140</strong>, which will be applied to your final total at check-in. The remaining balance will be collected upon arrival.</p><p><br></p><p><strong>Special Rates</strong></p><p>Alberta residents, AB seniors and junior rates are available at check-in with valid identification. Please inquire at the time of arrival to see if you qualify.</p><p><br></p><p>Thank you for choosing <strong>Kananaskis Country Golf Course</strong>. We look forward to welcoming you back when the course opens on <strong>Wednesday, May 6, 2026</strong>.</p><p><br></p><p>Warm regards,</p><p><strong>The Kananaskis Country Golf Course Team</strong></p>\",\"messageType\":\"Attention\"}}"
          },
